  "description": "I require retrospective permission to let out my self contained loft converted flat in 5 The Loning. Permission was granted in 2019 to build a loft at my property. It was used by my daughter after she came back from university and then it remained empty for a few years. In 2023 I let out the property through an estate agent to help with rising costs. I was unaware that to do this I first needed to obtain permission from Barnet Council. I have been approached by the council to apply for full planning permission and I would like to do this asap as they have given me a deadline of 27th April 2026.",
